  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#BuktiCuacaMemengaruhiPopulasiBemisiaTabaciPadaPenyakitSamarKacangTunggakCowpeaMildMottleVirusKedelai">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#BuktiSumber"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">Bukti sumber: Cuaca memengaruhi populasi Bemisia tabaci pada Penyakit Samar Kacang Tunggak (Cowpea Mild Mottle Virus)</rdfs:label>
    <kbr:dokumenSumber>SRC_EXT_039</kbr:dokumenSumber>
    <kbr:identifierSumber>Results 3.2 Whitefly Survey</kbr:identifierSumber>
    <kbr:kutipanSumber>No whiteflies could be collected from four sites because no insects were found infesting soybean (Itai, Piraju, Santa Cruz do Rio Pardo, and Taquarituba) probably due to the rainy weather.</kbr:kutipanSumber>
    <kbr:kutipanNormalisasi>No whiteflies could be collected from four sites because no insects were found infesting soybean (Itai, Piraju, Santa Cruz do Rio Pardo, and Taquarituba) probably due to the rainy weather.</kbr:kutipanNormalisasi>
    <kbr:catatanKualitas xml:lang="id">confidence=medium; review_status=verified; relation_type=vector_mediated</kbr:catatanKualitas>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#JurnalSRCEXT039"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="id">Bukti sumber: Cuaca memengaruhi populasi Bemisia tabaci pada Penyakit Samar Kacang Tunggak (Cowpea Mild Mottle Virus); SRC_EXT_039.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
