    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="id">Bukti sumber untuk tindakan pengendalian eksternal.</rdfs:comment>
    <kbr:kutipanSumber>Mosaic disease can be controlled effectively through the use of healthy or virus free planting materials.</kbr:kutipanSumber>
