    <kbr:identifierSumber>Results 3.1 symptoms and prevalence</kbr:identifierSumber>
    <kbr:kutipanSumber>In contrast, the disease incidence was lower from August and September to December, suggesting that symptom expression occurred more in the dry season than in the rainy season.</kbr:kutipanSumber>
    <kbr:kutipanNormalisasi>In contrast, the disease incidence was lower from August and September to December, suggesting that symptom expression occurred more in the dry season than in the rainy season.</kbr:kutipanNormalisasi>
