    <rdfs:label xml:lang="id">Bukti sumber: Kelembapan tinggi dan daun basah pada Penyakit Bercak Target</rdfs:label>
    <kbr:dokumenSumber>SRC_EXT_011</kbr:dokumenSumber>
    <kbr:identifierSumber>Disease Cycle and Favorable Conditions for Disease, paragraph 1</kbr:identifierSumber>
    <kbr:kutipanSumber>Target spot generally requires very wet conditions, with free water resting on the leaves for infection to take place. Wet, warm conditions persisting for several days can result in a sudden increase in target spot infection.</kbr:kutipanSumber>
    <kbr:kutipanNormalisasi>Target spot generally requires very wet conditions, with free water resting on the leaves for infection to take place. Wet, warm conditions persisting for several days can result in a sudden increase in target spot infection.</kbr:kutipanNormalisasi>
    <kbr:catatanKualitas xml:lang="id">confidence=high; review_status=verified; relation_type=direct</kbr:catatanKualitas>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="http://kbr.kelompok5.org/penyakit-tanaman-pangan#PublikasiSRCEXT011"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="id">Bukti sumber: Kelembapan tinggi dan daun basah pada Penyakit Bercak Target; SRC_EXT_011.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
