    <kbr:identifierSumber>Section 2.2 Disease cycle, paragraph 1</kbr:identifierSumber>
    <kbr:kutipanSumber>When conditions are favourable, especially high humidity, multiplication of the pathogen increases around trichomes and penetration of the outer layer takes place (Daniel &amp; Boher, 1985a).</kbr:kutipanSumber>
